{
   /* Demo of the native declarative menu primitive.
      `menu <screen>` draws the screen then waits for a key; each `on` routes
      by key with optional level/keys/password gates + a fail message.
      `script` actions run and return to the menu; `goto` leaves it.
      Reached from the main menu with the 'Y' hot-key. */

   menu `<Converse$Dir>.BBS.Screens.MenuDemo`
      on `t`  script `<Converse$Dir>.BBS.ScriptTest`
      on `s`  level 500  fail `Sorry, that's sysops only.`  script `<Converse$Dir>.BBS.ScriptTest`
      on `q`  goto md_done
   endmenu

label md_done
   cls
   print `Left the menu - back to the main board.`
   anykey
   return
}
